  "_doc": "Hand-maintained gig corrections. `add` = shows setlist.fm doesn't have (date may be month-precision 'YYYY-MM' + approx:1; copySongsFrom clones another gig's setlist — e.g. a festival set that repeated a documented one). `override` = fix a setlist.fm entry's fields in place (match by artist + optional date). build-data merges this into ROTATION.GIGS.",
