      "set": {
        "date": "2013-05-31",
        "venue": "Ursynalia (SGGW campus)",
        "city": "Warsaw",
        "tour": "",
        "url": ""
      },
      "note": "Fuad saw Pendulum at Ursynalia, not at Klub Stodola in 2010 — setlist.fm has no entry for the festival set, so the 2010 Warsaw show had been standing in for it. Ursynalia 2013 ran 31 May to 2 June on the SGGW campus; Pendulum played a DJ set on the Open Stage in the small hours of the 31st. The url is cleared because it pointed at the Stodola setlist; songs were already empty."
    }
